      "type": "single",
      "prompt": "How many lines are counted before the temporary file is deleted?\n\n```java\nvar path = java.nio.file.Files.createTempFile(\"expenses-\", \".txt\");\ntry {\n  java.nio.file.Files.writeString(path, \"Food:1250\\nBus:300\\n\", java.nio.charset.StandardCharsets.UTF_8);\n  try (var lines = java.nio.file.Files.lines(path, java.nio.charset.StandardCharsets.UTF_8)) {\n    System.out.println(lines.count());\n  }\n} finally {\n  java.nio.file.Files.deleteIfExists(path);\n}\n```",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "a",
          "text": "3"
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": "2"
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "text": "1"
        },
        {
          "id": "d",
          "text": "0"
        }
      ],
      "correct": [
        "b"
      ],
      "explanation": "A temporary path is allocated for this experiment. UTF-8 writes two records; the line stream counts 2. The stream closes before the temporary file is deleted.",
